WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.615
Nobody recorded this voice.

00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:04.617
No cloud service generated it.

00:00:04.947 --> 00:00:05.833
This Mac did.

00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:09.385
apple-llm can now speak, and listen.

00:00:09.435 --> 00:00:12.367
Using the voices and recognition already in your Mac.

00:00:13.553 --> 00:00:14.598
One command.

00:00:15.539 --> 00:00:16.524
Rishi: Hello there.

00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:18.213
And your Mac says it out loud.

00:00:18.953 --> 00:00:20.915
Every voice on your Mac, by name.

00:00:20.965 --> 00:00:21.678
Samantha: Hello.

00:00:21.628 --> 00:00:22.517
Tara: Namaste.

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:23.366
Thomas: Bonjour.

00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:24.272
Anna: Guten Tag.

00:00:24.222 --> 00:00:25.175
Kyoko: こんにちは。

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:25.908
Lekha: नमस्ते।

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:26.422
Paulina: Hola.

00:00:26.372 --> 00:00:27.904
Zarvox: I am also a voice.

00:00:27.974 --> 00:00:30.276
184 on this Mac.

00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:32.627
Need thirty minutes of narration?

00:00:34.572 --> 00:00:36.523
It renders in under twenty seconds.

00:00:38.153 --> 00:00:39.320
It listens as well.

00:00:41.188 --> 00:00:44.899
Give it any recording, and every word comes back with its own timestamp.

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:47.170
Thirty minutes takes under thirty seconds.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.210
Or use the microphone, in real time.

00:00:50.153 --> 00:00:52.766
In Node or Python, it is one function call.

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:55.637
Or point an OpenAI client at the local server.

00:00:56.753 --> 00:00:57.807
No API key.

00:00:57.807 --> 00:00:58.648
No account.

00:00:58.648 --> 00:01:00.066
Nothing leaves this Mac.

00:01:00.953 --> 00:01:03.469
Every voice in this video came from this Mac.

00:01:03.599 --> 00:01:05.199
apple-llm. Try it.
